  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In FCC octahedral voids are present at the edge centers and body center.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bf66da33-04ef-4ca9-9b22-754f8efdff3b-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 280px;\" /></p><p>Minimum distance between centers of two octahedral voids</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
